msgid "strict_bilingual_docs_and_diagrams_verified"
msgstr "strict_bilingual_docs_and_diagrams_verified"

msgid "本表包含 139 条原记录，仅表示来源行数。"
msgstr "本表包含 139 条原记录，仅表示来源行数。"

msgid "QB01"
msgstr "QB01"

msgid "P0: Freeze schematic identity and reviewed differences"
msgstr "P0：冻结原理图身份与已审差异"

msgid "schematic_and_source_reviewed_no_new_runtime_execution"
msgstr "schematic_and_source_reviewed_no_new_runtime_execution"

msgid "boards"
msgstr "boards"

msgid "Record both PDF hashes and page/component/net references; schematic facts never establish fitted hardware or PCB inspection."
msgstr "记录两份 PDF 的哈希，以及页码、元件和网络引用；原理图事实不证明实物器件安装或 PCB 检查。"

msgid "QB02"
msgstr "QB02"

msgid "P0: Introduce two independent exact Qiming Board packages"
msgstr "P0：建立两个独立的精确启明 Board 包"

msgid "in_progress"
msgstr "in_progress"

msgid "Depends on QB01. Core and high-configuration V4.1 resolve independently; original V3.1 bytes and identity remain unchanged; PCB revision remains unknown until inspected."
msgstr "依赖 QB01。核心板和高配 V4.1 独立解析；原 V3.1 字节与身份保持不变；PCB 修订在实物检查前继续未知。"

msgid "QB03"
msgstr "QB03"

msgid "P0: Model population jumper and electrical selections"
msgstr "P0：建模器件安装、跳线与电气选择"

msgid "Depends on QB01. No invented defaults; absent or unknown devices and unmet jumper conditions reject selected bindings; declarations do not establish physical proof."
msgstr "依赖 QB01。不引入虚构默认值；器件缺失、型号未知或跳线条件未满足时，拒绝选中绑定；配置声明不建立物理证明。"

msgid "QB04"
msgstr "QB04"

msgid "P0: Bind hardware selections and PDF provenance into typed configuration"
msgstr "P0：将硬件选择与 PDF 来源绑定到强类型配置"

msgid "Depends on QB02;QB03. Unknown keys and choices reject; immutable selections survive explain and source SDK consumption; one configuration authority and static emission remain."
msgstr "依赖 QB02;QB03。拒绝未知键和选项；不可变选择保留在 explain 和 Source SDK 消费中；保持唯一配置权威与静态生成。"

msgid "QB05"
msgstr "QB05"

msgid "P0: Implement actual GPIO routes and electrical modes"
msgstr "P0：实现实际 GPIO 路由与电气模式"

msgid "Depends on QB04. Exact package ports and pins support input pulls and output drive; inactive levels precede output mode; failed setup and stop preserve ownership."
msgstr "依赖 QB04。精确封装端口和引脚支持输入上下拉与输出驱动；进入输出模式前设置非活动电平；设置或停机失败时保留所有权。"

msgid "QB06"
msgstr "QB06"

msgid "P0: Extend EXTI lines and real vector ownership"
msgstr "P0：扩展 EXTI 线与真实中断向量所有权"

msgid "Depends on QB05. Selected lines including PF11 use the correct vector; shared owners stop independently; event overflow and rejected initialization remain observable."
msgstr "依赖 QB05。PF11 等选定线路使用正确向量；共享 owner 可独立停机；事件溢出和初始化拒绝仍可观察。"

msgid "QB07"
msgstr "QB07"

msgid "P0: Review six UART instances and selected transport modes"
msgstr "P0：评审六个 UART 实例及选定传输模式"

msgid "Depends on QB04. USART1/2/3/6 and UART4/5 have exact clock IRQ gate and pad admission; existing modes remain; no unimplemented DMA mode is advertised."
msgstr "依赖 QB04。USART1/2/3/6 与 UART4/5 具有精确时钟、中断、门控和引脚准入；保留既有模式；不宣称未实现的 DMA 模式。"

msgid "QB08"
msgstr "QB08"

msgid "P0: Add actual SPI and I2C routes without capability drift"
msgstr "P0：接入实际 SPI 和 I2C 路由，避免能力漂移"

msgid "Depends on QB04. SPI1 PB3/PB4/PB5 and reviewed I2C1 alternatives match real C admission; preserve SWD and reject conflicting complete JTAG ownership."
msgstr "依赖 QB04。SPI1 PB3/PB4/PB5 和已审 I2C1 替代路由与真实 C 准入一致；保留 SWD，拒绝冲突的完整 JTAG 所有权。"

msgid "QB09"
msgstr "QB09"

msgid "P0: Deliver safe minimal Board startup and shutdown"
msgstr "P0：交付安全的最小 Board 启动与停机"

msgid "Depends on QB05;QB07. Correct two-versus-three LEDs and two-versus-four keys; UART electrical route and CS DE backlight levels are explicit; complete cleanup is proved or retained."
msgstr "依赖 QB05;QB07。准确区分两/三盏 LED 和两/四个按键；明确 UART 电气路由以及 CS、DE、背光电平；证明完整清理，或保留未归还责任。"

msgid "QB10"
msgstr "QB10"

msgid "P1: Add an AT24C02 device component"
msgstr "P1：增加 AT24C02 器件组件"

msgid "Depends on QB08. Address 0x50 geometry page boundaries write-cycle ACK progress and failures execute against the actual device transport; product storage layout stays external."
msgstr "依赖 QB08。地址 0x50、几何、页边界、写周期 ACK 推进和失败路径均执行真实器件传输；产品存储布局留在外部。"

msgid "QB11"
msgstr "QB11"

msgid "P1: Add a selected W25 SPI NOR component"
msgstr "P1：增加显式选定的 W25 SPI NOR 组件"

msgid "Depends on QB08;QB03. Expected JEDEC identity and geometry are checked; finite program erase busy and error paths preserve ownership; core unpopulated NOR stays disabled."
msgstr "依赖 QB08;QB03。检查预期 JEDEC 身份和几何；有限编程、擦除、忙状态及错误路径保留所有权；核心板空贴 NOR 保持禁用。"

msgid "QB12"
msgstr "QB12"

msgid "P1: Bind both Boards actual CAN routes and electrical conditions"
msgstr "P1：绑定两块 Board 的实际 CAN 路由与电气条件"

msgid "Depends on QB04;QB09. Core CAN1 PB8/PB9 and high-configuration PA11/PA12 are distinct; CAN2 jumper and shared-filter ownership are reviewed; no transceiver or termination is invented."
msgstr "依赖 QB04;QB09。区分核心板 CAN1 PB8/PB9 与高配板 PA11/PA12；评审 CAN2 跳线及共享滤波器所有权；不虚构收发器或终端电阻。"

msgid "QB13"
msgstr "QB13"

msgid "P1: Compose exact RS232 and RS485 paths"
msgstr "P1：装配精确 RS232 与 RS485 路径"

msgid "Depends on QB07;QB09;QB03. Declared transceiver supply and P15/PG6 direction are checked; true wire-tail and cleanup execute; standard PA2 Ethernet/RS485 conflict rejects."
msgstr "依赖 QB07;QB09;QB03。检查声明的收发器供电和 P15/PG6 方向；执行真实线上尾部完成与清理；拒绝标准 PA2 以太网/RS485 冲突。"

msgid "QB14"
msgstr "QB14"

msgid "P1: Bind actual USB full-speed paths"
msgstr "P1：绑定实际 USB 全速路径"

msgid "Depends on QB03;QB09. P21 USB/CAN selection and VBUS/ID facts remain explicit; OTG_HS internal FS and external ULPI HS are not confused; host support is not inferred."
msgstr "依赖 QB03;QB09。明确 P21 USB/CAN 选择与 VBUS/ID 事实；区分 OTG_HS 内部 FS 和外部 ULPI HS；不推导 host 支持。"

msgid "QB15"
msgstr "QB15"

msgid "P1: Compose V4.1 MAC DP83848 and network transport"
msgstr "P1：装配 V4.1 MAC、DP83848 和网络传输"

msgid "Depends on QB03;QB04;QB09. Exact PHY identity address reference clock P5 and receive-valid variant are reviewed; application network policy stays external; unknown wiring is not repaired silently."
msgstr "依赖 QB03;QB04;QB09。评审精确 PHY 身份、地址、参考时钟、P5 及接收有效信号变体；应用网络策略留在外部；不静默修复未知接线。"

msgid "QB16"
msgstr "QB16"

msgid "P1: Integrate F407 RTC LSE and backup-domain lifecycle"
msgstr "P1：接入 F407 RTC、LSE 和后备域生命周期"

msgid "Depends on QB04;QB09. Calendar and time-domain boundaries execute; LSE failure and retained backup state are explicit; no battery fitting or measured retention is inferred."
msgstr "依赖 QB04;QB09。执行日历和时间域边界；明确 LSE 失败及后备状态保留；不推导电池安装或实测保持能力。"

msgid "QB17"
msgstr "QB17"

msgid "P2: Implement one shared FSMC owner with independent banks"
msgstr "P2：实现一个共享 FSMC owner 和独立存储区"

msgid "Depends on QB04;QB05. Shared pads and gate have one owner; NE3 SRAM and NE4 LCD own distinct windows and timing; rollback and close never restore another live bank."
msgstr "依赖 QB04;QB05。共享引脚和门控具有唯一 owner；NE3 SRAM 与 NE4 LCD 分别拥有窗口和时序；回滚与关闭不能恢复另一活跃存储区的资源。"

msgid "QB18"
msgstr "QB18"

msgid "P2: Implement SRAM windows and optional pre-runtime initialization"
msgstr "P2：实现 SRAM 窗口与可选运行时前初始化"

msgid "Depends on QB17;QB03. Internal bootstrap initializes selected FSMC before external data/bss; CPU and DMA reachability are separate; boot-backed memory prevents unsafe withdrawal."
msgstr "依赖 QB17;QB03。内部引导在访问外部 data/bss 前初始化选定 FSMC；分别评审 CPU 与 DMA 可达性；承载启动存储的内存阻止不安全归还。"

msgid "QB19"
msgstr "QB19"

msgid "P2: Integrate the confirmed ILI9341 16-bit display"
msgstr "P2：接入已确认的 ILI9341 16 位显示"

msgid "Depends on QB17;QB18. Actual command/data address shift and controller identity are checked; 240x320 RGB565 rectangle and error paths execute; shared NRST is not an invented reset GPIO."
msgstr "依赖 QB17;QB18。检查实际命令/数据地址位移和控制器身份；执行 240x320 RGB565 矩形及错误路径；不能将共享 NRST 虚构为独立复位 GPIO。"

msgid "QB20"
msgstr "QB20"

msgid "P2: Integrate confirmed XPT2046 through bounded software SPI"
msgstr "P2：通过有界软件 SPI 接入已确认的 XPT2046"

msgid "Depends on QB05;QB06. PA5/PB1/PB2/PB0/PF11 route and mode are explicit; raw 12-bit sampling and final PENIRQ power state execute; uncertain pin cleanup retains bus ownership."
msgstr "依赖 QB05;QB06。明确 PA5/PB1/PB2/PB0/PF11 路由与模式；执行原始 12 位采样和最终 PENIRQ 电源状态；引脚清理不确定时保留总线所有权。"

msgid "QB21"
msgstr "QB21"

msgid "P2: Implement block I/O and F407 SDIO host ownership"
msgstr "P2：实现 block I/O 与 F407 SDIO host 所有权"

msgid "Depends on QB04. PC8-PC12/PD2 command and data paths handle CRC timeout cancellation and removal; no unconnected card-detect GPIO is invented; buffers end only after detach."
msgstr "依赖 QB04。PC8-PC12/PD2 命令和数据路径处理 CRC、超时、取消和移除；不虚构未连接的卡检测 GPIO；完成脱离后才结束缓冲区借用。"

msgid "QB22"
msgstr "QB22"

msgid "P2: Integrate SD card protocol and optional filesystem port"
msgstr "P2：接入 SD 卡协议与可选文件系统端口"

msgid "Depends on QB21. Selected card geometry and bounded block reads/writes execute; optional filesystem policy stays distinct; product directories and persistence remain external."
msgstr "依赖 QB21。执行所选卡几何和有界 block 读写；可选文件系统策略保持独立；产品目录和持久化策略留在外部。"

msgid "QB23"
msgstr "QB23"

msgid "P2: Implement bounded software two-wire and SCCB ports"
msgstr "P2：实现有界软件双线与 SCCB 端口"

msgid "Depends on QB05. Actual PC0/PC13 and PD6/PD7 paths use release/read semantics with explicit timing and ACK/SCCB differences; no hidden task or long global IRQ mask."
msgstr "依赖 QB05。实际 PC0/PC13 和 PD6/PD7 路径采用释放/读取语义，明确时序及 ACK/SCCB 差异；不引入隐藏任务或长时间全局中断屏蔽。"

msgid "QB24"
msgstr "QB24"

msgid "P2: Integrate selected WM8978 audio and complete I2S mode"
msgstr "P2：接入选定 WM8978 音频与完整 I2S 模式"

msgid "Depends on QB23;QB04. Actual module must be selected; PB12/PB13/PC2/PC3/PC6 clock sample-rate RX/TX DMA and full withdrawal execute; finite slave TX is not full audio qualification."
msgstr "依赖 QB23;QB04。必须选择实际模块；执行 PB12/PB13/PC2/PC3/PC6 时钟、采样率、RX/TX DMA 及完整归还；有限从机 TX 不等于完整音频资格。"

msgid "QB25"
msgstr "QB25"

msgid "P2: Integrate the alternative selected VS1053 module"
msgstr "P2：接入替代的选定 VS1053 模块"

msgid "Depends on QB07;QB08. Actual module must be selected; SPI2 alternate route dual CS DREQ and reset execute; WM8978 and VS1053 cannot own the same connector simultaneously."
msgstr "依赖 QB07;QB08。必须选择实际模块；执行 SPI2 替代路由、双 CS、DREQ 和复位；WM8978 与 VS1053 不能同时拥有同一连接器。"

msgid "QB26"
msgstr "QB26"

msgid "P2: Integrate DCMI and an exact OV2640 capture configuration"
msgstr "P2：接入 DCMI 和精确 OV2640 采集配置"

msgid "Depends on QB18;QB23;QB04. Actual module format and rate are fixed; XCLK SCCB frame boundaries malformed frames and DMA withdrawal execute with declared static memory and bandwidth budgets."
msgstr "依赖 QB18;QB23;QB04。固定实际模块格式和帧率；在声明的静态内存与带宽预算内执行 XCLK、SCCB、帧边界、畸形帧及 DMA 归还。"

msgid "QB27"
msgstr "QB27"

msgid "P2: Integrate selected DS18B20 and HS0038 devices"
msgstr "P2：接入选定 DS18B20 与 HS0038 器件"

msgid "Depends on QB05. OneWire only pulls low or releases and declares any strong-pullup requirement; infrared timing overflow and selected protocol execute without product calibration policy."
msgstr "依赖 QB05。OneWire 仅拉低或释放，并声明所需强上拉；执行红外时序溢出和选定协议，不包含产品校准策略。"

msgid "QB28"
msgstr "QB28"

msgid "P0: Validate clock DMA IRQ and memory combination budgets"
msgstr "P0：验证时钟、DMA、IRQ 和内存组合预算"

msgid "Depends on QB04. Physical DMA Stream exclusivity cannot be bypassed by different channel numbers; TIM2 stays reserved; audio/video buffer reach and bandwidth are explicit."
msgstr "依赖 QB04。不同 channel 编号不能绕过物理 DMA Stream 独占；TIM2 保持保留；明确音视频缓冲区可达性和带宽。"

msgid "QB29"
msgstr "QB29"

msgid "P2: Deliver legal combinations and external application examples"
msgstr "P2：交付合法组合与外部应用示例"

msgid "Depends on QB09;QB10;QB11;QB12;QB13;QB14;QB15;QB16;QB18;QB19;QB20;QB22;QB24;QB25;QB26;QB27;QB28. Minimal serial CAN network storage HMI and selected media profiles consume public interfaces; impossible standard wiring rejects; private application evidence stays private."
msgstr "依赖 QB09;QB10;QB11;QB12;QB13;QB14;QB15;QB16;QB18;QB19;QB20;QB22;QB24;QB25;QB26;QB27;QB28。最小串口、CAN、网络、存储、HMI 和选定媒体配置消费公共接口；拒绝标准接线下不可能的组合；私有应用证据保持私有。"

msgid "QB30"
msgstr "QB30"

msgid "P0: Execute genuine TDD and final source-bound software matrix"
msgstr "P0：执行真实 TDD 与绑定最终源码的软件矩阵"

msgid "Depends on QB01. Meaningful original RED precedes new behavior then GREEN; actual ARM and installed SDK images and resource costs bind exact inputs; no existence-only or stale-pass substitution."
msgstr "依赖 QB01。有意义的原始 RED 先于新行为，随后 GREEN；实际 ARM、安装后 SDK 镜像和资源成本绑定精确输入；不能以文件存在或旧通过记录替代。"

msgid "QB31"
msgstr "QB31"

msgid "P2: Deliver bilingual Board guidance and evidence navigation"
msgstr "P2：交付双语 Board 指导与证据导航"

msgid "Depends on QB02;QB29;QB30. One existing ledger records exact mode source schematic and declared population identities with actual software results and unexecuted physical scope; both locales stay reviewed."
msgstr "依赖 QB02;QB29;QB30。同一既有台账记录精确模式、源码、原理图及声明安装身份，以及实际软件结果和未执行的物理范围；两种语言保持已审。"

msgid "QB32"
msgstr "QB32"

msgid "P3: Prepare and execute exact Board HIL admission"
msgstr "P3：准备并执行精确 Board HIL 准入"

msgid "Depends on QB09;QB29;QB30;QB31. Station binds PCB BOM jumper profile and fact digests; real startup clock serial buses storage USB network and failed-stop behavior execute; disconnected hardware remains not_executed."
msgstr "依赖 QB09;QB29;QB30;QB31。站点绑定 PCB、BOM、跳线配置与事实摘要；实际执行启动、时钟、串口、总线、存储、USB、网络及失败停机行为；未连接硬件继续为 not_executed。"

